From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gopikrishna Garmidi <gopikrishna.garmidi@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 02:50:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] platform/surface: aggregator_registry: Add Surface Laptop 8th
 Edition

The Mahua-based Surface Laptop 13.8" 8th Edition exposes the same SAM
client devices as the Surface Laptop 7: keyboard, fan and platform
profile. Battery and AC status come from pmic-glink here as well, so
the Surface Laptop 7 node group can be reused as is.

Signed-off-by: Gopikrishna Garmidi <gopikrishna.garmidi@oss.qualcomm.com>
Reviewed-by: Dmitry Baryshkov <dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20261006-mahua-surface-laptop-v1-3-406fc042162a@oss.qualcomm.com
[Jim Martin: use the compatible of the board DT carried here until the
 board name is settled upstream]
Signed-off-by: Jim Martin <jimmartin@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/platform/surface/surface_aggregator_registry.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/platform/surface/surface_aggregator_registry.c b/drivers/platform/surface/surface_aggregator_registry.c
index 7b42e0038eb..d6b3cae2ffe 100644
--- a/drivers/platform/surface/surface_aggregator_registry.c
+++ b/drivers/platform/surface/surface_aggregator_registry.c
@@ -530,6 +530,8 @@ static const struct of_device_id ssam_platform_hub_of_match[] __maybe_unused = {
 	/* Surface Laptop 7 */
 	{ .compatible = "microsoft,romulus13", (void *)ssam_node_group_sl7 },
 	{ .compatible = "microsoft,romulus15", (void *)ssam_node_group_sl7 },
+	/* Surface Laptop 8th Edition (13.8") */
+	{ .compatible = "microsoft,surface-laptop8", (void *)ssam_node_group_sl7 },
 	{ },
 };
 
-- 
